{
  "_doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md「完整玩法规格」的可机械核对断言 → 代码载体。一条一个对象。",
  "_kinds": "carrier.kind ∈ {config, behavior, java-const}；config 读 plugins/<mod>/src/main/resources/config.yml；behavior 指向已存在的行为级 JUnit 测试；java-const 结构化解析编译期常量。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "M-CORE-001",
      "section": "角色成长",
      "doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md",
      "doc_lines": "15-20",
      "claim": "显示等级上限：0转 30 / 1转 60 / 2转 90 / 3转 120（四段式有效等级 1-120）",
      "carrier": {
        "kind": "java-const",
        "path": "plugins/rpg-api/src/main/java/cn/originalrpg/api/rules/ProgressionRules.java",
        "const": "LOCAL_LEVEL_CAP",
        "expect": 30
      },
      "note": "本地等级上限是各段共享的编译期契约，被 ProgressionRules.effectiveLevel 等在全仓引用；有效上限 120 由 MAX_ASCENSION*LEVELS_PER_ASCENSION+LOCAL_LEVEL_CAP 派生，不是某个插件的可调配置。",
      "behavior_ref": "plugins/rpg-api/src/test/java/cn/originalrpg/api/rules/ProgressionRulesTest.java#stageCapsFollowTheReleasePlan"
    },
    {
      "id": "M-CORE-002",
      "section": "角色成长",
      "doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md",
      "doc_lines": "19-20",
      "claim": "2 转显示等级上限 90 / 3 转 120：有效等级 = 转数*30 + 本地等级，3 转满级有效 120",
      "carrier": {
        "kind": "behavior",
        "test": "plugins/rpg-api/src/test/java/cn/originalrpg/api/rules/ProgressionRulesTest.java#effectiveLevelCapIsTheTerminalEffectiveCap",
        "asserts": "effectiveLevelCap()==120 且 effectiveLevel(3,30)==最多，证明四段 30/60/90/120"
      },
      "note": "公式类断言必须走行为级测试，不用 Java 字符串匹配。"
    },
    {
      "id": "M-CORE-003",
      "section": "角色成长",
      "doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md",
      "doc_lines": "28",
      "claim": "0/1/2/3 转分别开放技能 Lv.2/3/4/5",
      "carrier": {
        "kind": "config",
        "path": "plugins/rpg-skills/src/main/resources/config.yml",
        "key": "skill-leveling.maximum-level-by-ascension",
        "expect": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5
        ]
      },
      "note": "技能等级上限按转数在 config.yml 配置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "M-CORE-004",
      "section": "角色成长",
      "doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md",
