      "note": "升级点成本在 config.yml 配置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "M-CORE-005",
      "section": "角色成长",
      "doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md",
      "doc_lines": "28",
      "claim": "每升一级使该技能的基础冷却缩短 4%，最终最多缩短 16%",
      "carrier": {
        "kind": "config",
        "path": "plugins/rpg-skills/src/main/resources/config.yml",
        "key": "skill-leveling.cooldown-reduction-per-level",
        "expect": 0.04
      },
      "note": "每级冷却缩减是 config.yml 值；4 级*4%=16% 的上限由 minimum-cooldown-multiplier 0.84 承载（M-CORE-006）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "M-CORE-006",
      "section": "角色成长",
      "doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md",
      "doc_lines": "28",
      "claim": "技能冷却最多缩短 16%（即冷却最低保留 0.84 倍基础值）",
      "carrier": {
        "kind": "config",
        "path": "plugins/rpg-skills/src/main/resources/config.yml",
        "key": "skill-leveling.minimum-cooldown-multiplier",
        "expect": 0.84
      },
      "note": "下限乘区在 config.yml 配置，行为由 SkillLevelRulesTest 覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "M-CORE-007",
      "section": "角色成长",
      "doc": "docs/GAME_DESIGN.md",
      "doc_lines": "28",
      "claim": "每升一级使该技能的基础冷却缩短 4%：由共享冷却管线行为承载",
      "carrier": {
        "kind": "behavior",
        "test": "plugins/rpg-skills/src/test/java/cn/originalrpg/skills/SkillLevelRulesTest.java#allFiveLevelsHaveStrictlyBetterButBoundedCooldowns",
        "asserts": "20s 基础、每级 -4%、下限 0.84 ⇒ Lv.1=20000ms、Lv.5=16800ms（=20000*0.84），五级严格递减且不越下限"
      },
      "note": "公式类断言走行为级测试。"
    },
    {
